{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-82dda5edc22237aa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8004-E002\n3\ttitle: Enable and validate the pgvector remote vector_io provider in the OGX distribution\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8004\n5\tcomponent: OGX Core\n6\tteam: Gen AI Studio\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 1\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 9\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Enable and validate the pgvector remote vector_io provider in the OGX distribution\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tMakes the pgvector remote vector store usable as the OGX vector_io provider for\n34\tGen AI Studio playground RAG, replacing reliance on the inline Milvus provider\n35\tthat RHAISTRAT-7474 removes from the distribution. The existing remote vector\n36\tstore implementation is largely reusable; the work is to enable and validate the\n37\tremote pgvector provider path in the OGX distribution configuration. The\n38\tapplication storage backend is a separate, independent configuration and remains\n39\ton its existing SQLite default — no storage consolidation and no\n40\tSQLite-to-PostgreSQL migration are in scope.\n41\t\n42\t## Scope\n43\t\n44\t- Enable and verify the remote pgvector vector_io provider activation path in\n45\t  the OGX distribution configuration (the environment-guarded remote pgvector\n46\t  provider setting).\n47\t- Validate vector insert and similarity-query round-trips through the OGX\n48\t  vector_io API against a pgvector-backed PostgreSQL instance, using\n49\t  representative playground RAG document embeddings.\n50\t- Confirm the application storage backend (key-value and SQL stores) remains on\n51\t  its existing SQLite default, unchanged by this work.\n52\t- Confirm the vector store runs as a separate process decoupled from the OGX\n53\t  server (a remote provider, not an inline provider).\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- With the pgvector provider environment configuration set, the OGX server\n58\t  exposes a functioning vector_io API backed by a separate PostgreSQL/pgvector\n59\t  instance.\n60\t- Vector insert and similarity-query round-trips through the vector_io API\n61\t  succeed against the pgvector backend with representative playground RAG\n62\t  document embeddings.\n63\t- The application storage backend remains unchanged (existing SQLite default);\n64\t  no storage consolidation or migration is introduced.\n65\t- The vector store runs as a separate process decoupled from the OGX server\n66\t  (remote provider, not inline).\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- AC-2 (Gen AI Studio playground RAG workflows function with the default vector\n71\t  store, no loss of current capability).\n72\t- AC-4 (default vector store runs as a separate process, decoupled from the\n73\t  OGX instance — not an inline provider).\n74\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a70d2993287eb728","agent_id":"a948999cdbd9c303c","session_id":"6460c734-9da5-4d64-9956-6c822c41e6b0","uuid":"c18f0acd-de7b-4fd0-a9c7-29525ad1e4e4","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:21:34.825Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-82dda5edc22237aa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8004 decomposition"}
